<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-FAKTO GROUP'S CAR SALES BEAT H1 FORECAST.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-FAKTO GROUP'S CAR SALES BEAT H1 FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fakto Group said on Friday that its car  sales for the first half of the year were above expectations with  66 percent of forecast sales reached in the first six months.</p>
<p>Fakto said in a statement that it sold 673 new cars in 1997 and that  its sales target according to its business plan was 1,020 car sales  for the year.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
